#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spiders 3"
msgstr "Arañas 3"

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spider3"
msgstr "Spider3"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Objective"
msgstr "Objetivo"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Programa"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Ver también"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr "<a cbot>Programación</a>, <a cbot|type>tipos</a> y <a cbot|category>categorías</a>."

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn to move the bot so that no spider can escape."
msgstr "Aprende a mover el bot para que ninguna araña pueda escapar."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move towards the spiders that are out of shooting range."
msgstr "Muévete hacia las arañas que están fuera del alcance de disparo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "The program will look like the previous one, but before you shoot, use the instruction <c/><a cbot|move>move</a>();<n/> in order to get close enough."
msgstr "El programa será similar al anterior, pero antes de disparar, usa la instrucción <c/><a cbot|move>mover</a>();<n/> para acercarte lo suficiente."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(<a cbot|dist>distance</a>(position, item.position)-40);"
msgstr "\t<a cbot|move>mover</a>(<a cbot|dist>distancia</a>(position, item.position)-40);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Just insert this line into the program before the instruction <c/>fire(1);<n/>, and the bot will start to move."
msgstr "Simplemente inserta esta línea en el programa antes de la instrucción <c/>fire(1);<n/>, y el bot comenzará a moverse."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "The question is just how many meters the bot must move. The instruction <code><a cbot|dist>distance</a>( , )</code> calculates the distance between two positions. In this case, we need to know the distance between the bot and the target. The position of the target is given by <code>item.position</code>, the position of the bot is given by <code>position</code>. The distance between the bot and the target is given by <code><a cbot|dist>distance</a>(position, item.position)</code>. The range of a fireball cannon is 40 meters. In order to get close enough, the bot must move forward <code><a cbot|dist>distance</a>(position, item.position)-40</code> meters. The following line will do this:"
msgstr "La cuestión es cuántos metros debe moverse el bot. La instrucción <code><a cbot|dist>distance</a>( , )</code> calcula la distancia entre dos posiciones. En este caso, necesitamos saber la distancia entre el bot y el objetivo. La posición del objetivo viene dada por <code>item.position</code>, la posición del bot viene dada por <code>position</code>. La distancia entre el bot y el objetivo viene dada por <code><a cbot|dist>distance</a>(position, item.position)</code>. El alcance de un cañón de bolas de fuego es de 40 metros. Para acercarse lo suficiente, el bot debe avanzar <code><a cbot|dist>distance</a>(position, item.position)-40</code> metros. La siguiente línea hará esto:"
